    "summaries": [
      {
        "action_date": "2025-06-26",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Veterans Border Patrol Training Act</strong></p><p>This bill requires the Department of Homeland Security (DHS) to collaborate with the Department of Defense (DOD) and Department of Veterans Affairs to establish a five-year interdepartmental pilot program, under which DHS must use the DOD SkillBridge Program to train and hire transitioning servicemembers as border patrol agents for U.S. Customs and Border Protection.</p>",
        "update_date": "2026-06-01T21:16:33Z"
      }
    ]
